@scenario welcome_note
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[bg office]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[if tutorial_still]
[show pip desk present]
[else]
[show pip doorway present]
[move pip doorway stride-a-right exprdur=0]
[move pip desk ease_out_cubic 520]
[wait 130]
[move pip desk stride-b-right exprdur=0]
[wait 130]
[move pip desk stride-c-right exprdur=0]
[wait 130]
[move pip desk stride-b-right exprdur=0]
[wait 130]
[move pip desk present exprdur=90]
[endif]
pip: Our new teammate starts tomorrow. What should happen when they open the game?
> Play the welcome chime -> chime
> Leave a handwritten note -> quiet
@label chime
[sfx assets/tutorial/welcome.wav]
[flag sent_chime]
[jump end]
@label quiet
[set sent_chime false]
[jump end]
@label end
[goto Epilogue:start]
